tn-list\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"watch_botton\">\n<div class=\"button_box\">\n<button class=\"the_first\">Product Details</button>\n<p><input id=\"productID\" name=\"productID\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"68553694\"/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;\"><strong>Big Flow Submersible Sewage Pump</strong></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;\"><img src=\"/admin.seo.com.cn/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271148519982632.jpg\" title=\"image007(001).jpg\"/></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;\">Big Flow Submersible Sewage Pump For many years, the name JIADI has been the representative of good quality and service, with about 100,000 pumps sold home and aboard. Our products like submersible dirty water pump have received high praise from our customers.</p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271148468236041.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image005(001).jpg\"/></p><p><br/></p><p><strong>1. Product specification</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td valign=\"top\" width=\"140\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Series</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"429\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">VS…F</p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"140\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Insulation class</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"429\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">B</p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"140\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Protection grade</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"429\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">IP68</p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"140\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Outlet</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"429\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">3</p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"140\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Motor power</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"429\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">2.2 KW</p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"429\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">3 HP</p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"140\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Head</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"429\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">2-16m</p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"140\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Capacity</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"429\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">0-43 m³/h</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>2. Performance Curve</strong></p><p><br/></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271150564803875.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image009.jpg\"/></p><p><strong>3. Spare Parts</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271151028523111.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image011.jpg\"/></p><p><strong>4. Product Application</strong></p><p>Mainly apply to delivery sewage water, waste water and rain water contains solids:</p><p>Municipal project</p><p>Building construction</p><p>Residential area</p><p>Industrial sewage treatment</p><p>Environment protect</p><p>Mining</p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271152029997437.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image013(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>5. Company Introduction</strong></p><p>JIADI Pump Industry is located in the world famous pump city---Wenling City, Zhejiang Province, mainly engaged in R&amp;D, producing and marketing of all kinds of submersible water pump sets. The sales network has been distributed all over the country, also exported to more than 70 countries, for example: the Middle East, Pakistan, Russian, Africa and so on. We are always looking for new cooperators.</p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271152062213544.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image015(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>6. Packing and Delivery</strong></p><p>Lead time: About 20-30 days. It depends on the quantity and special circumstances could happen.</p><p>Package: Plywood box or carton or according to your requirements</p><p>Port: Liangyugang, Ningbo and Shanghai port</p><p>Trade terms: FOB, CIF and CFR.</p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271152116217564.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image017(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>7. Exhibition Show</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271152165392224.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image019(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>8. FAQ</strong></p><p><strong>1. Q: How about the guarantee period?</strong></p><p>A: One year after the shipping date. </p><p><strong>2. How will you deal the problem if the pump was broken within the warranty?</strong></p><p>A: We will firstly help you find the core problem, maybe it is caused by some broken spare part. Then we will send you the new one to replace it. </p><p><strong>3. Q: Can you provide detailed technical data and drawing?</strong></p><p>A: Yes, we can. Please tell us which product you need and the applications, we will send the detailed technical data and drawing to you for your evaluation and confirm.</p><p><strong><br/></strong><br/></p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"productsTags\"> Hot Tags: big flow submersible sewage pump, China, suppliers, manufacturers, buy</p>\n<div class=\"ptit\">Related Products</div>\n<ul class=\"rollPro1\">\n<li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/2-5-submersible-pump/2-5-inch-submersible-screw-pump\"><img alt=\"2.5 Inch Submersible Screw Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/2-5-inch-submersible-screw-pump29410335098a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a></div>\n<p><a href=\"/2-5-submersible-pump/2-5-inch-submersible-screw-pump\">2.5 Inch Submersible Screw Pump</a></p>\n</li><li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/3-submersible-pump/3-submersible-impeller-pump/3-inch-submersible-well-pump\"><img alt=\"3 Inch Submersible Well Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/3-inch-submersible-well-pump44077508304a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a></div>\n<p><a href=\"/3-submersible-pump/3-submersible-impeller-pump/3-inch-submersible-well-pump\">3 Inch Submersible Well Pump</a></p>\n</li><li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/3-5-submersible-pump/3-5-inch-submersible-pump\"><img alt=\"3.5 Inch Submersible Pum